      "writtenOn": "2026-02-27T15:21:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If Android really wants the old behavior (and the old behavior is a bit faster on the CPU side but also less accurate) then they should set `SK_ENABLE_LEGACY_SHADERCONTEXT`. The issue with this old method of setting it was that there was effectively no signal of who actually wanted or needed this define.",
