      "writtenOn": "2026-02-27T19:06:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I ran the test locally and we\u0027re just off by one in the blue channel.  A quick fix that would accommodate both versions is to just bump the expected upper bound:\n\n```\n--- a/tests/tests/media/misc/src/android/media/misc/cts/ThumbnailUtilsTest.java\n+++ b/tests/tests/media/misc/src/android/media/misc/cts/ThumbnailUtilsTest.java\n@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@ public class ThumbnailUtilsTest {\n         // EXIF orientations to achieve the same final image, and this verifies that the EXIF\n         // orientation was applied properly.\n         assertColorMostlyInRange(bitmap.getPixel(bitmap.getWidth() / 2, bitmap.getHeight() / 3),\n-                0xFF232323 /* upperBound */, Color.BLACK);\n+                0xFF242424 /* upperBound */, Color.BLACK);\n     }\n\n     @Test\n```",
      "parentUuid": "e402142b_881b4f54",
      "revId": "f98eeb09ee03791748477dad02b2bbee12a5956e",
